    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "0F06E3421B55EBA9",
      "text": "나중에 마음이 바뀌거든\\n교환을 부탁하지.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_trade_04_00",
      "hash64": "59AEBC0A6433D32D",
      "text": "나와 포켓몬 교환을 할 건가?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
