    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_teacher_home_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "2C3FE8C528BC4995",
      "text": "나도 나름대로\\n충분히 단련했다고 생각했건만...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
